<protocol name="image_studio" type="tool_mastery" domain="shared">

## PURPOSE

Master the image_studio tool - professional image processing with Gemini 3 Pro Image.
Transform user uploads into catalog-ready assets: extract products, generate lifestyle scenes, create hero shots, compose product families.

---

## LABELED IMAGES ARCHITECTURE

The key differentiator of this tool: **labeled images + structured specs = intelligent composition**.

### Image Labels

```json
{
  "images": [
    {"path": "inbox/photo.jpg", "label": "product"},
    {"path": "inbox/mood.jpg", "label": "style_ref"}
  ]
}
```

Common labels:
| Label | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `product` / `source` | Main product to feature |
| `style_ref` | Lighting/mood reference - match its atmosphere |
| `background` | Background/scene reference |
| `product_variant` | Additional product for family shots |

### Label References in Specs

Reference labels using `[label]` syntax in specs:

```json
{
  "extraction": {"target_description": "glass jar in [source]"},
  "lighting": {"special_requirements": "match [style_ref]"},
  "placement": {"position": "place [product] on [background]"}
}
```

**Max 15 images** per call (Gemini constraint).

---

## STRUCTURED SPECS (All Optional)

Use what applies to your use case:

### extraction

```json
{
  "target_description": "glass jar on left in [source]",
  "isolation": "complete",
  "edge_treatment": "sharp"
}
```
Purpose: Extract product from messy background.

### background

```json
{
  "treatment": "transparent | solid_color | scene",
  "color": "white",
  "scene_description": "modern kitchen counter"
}
```
Purpose: Set the background after extraction or for compositing.

### lighting

```json
{
  "type": "natural_window | studio_3point",
  "direction": "front | side | top",
  "special_requirements": "match [style_ref]"
}
```
Purpose: Control lighting style and direction.

### composition

```json
{
  "position": "center | [main] center [variant] right",
  "camera_angle": "slight_top | eye_level | three_quarter",
  "negative_space": "generous_top | balanced"
}
```
Purpose: Control framing and arrangement.

### scene

```json
{
  "environment": "modern_kitchen | outdoor_garden",
  "style": "match [style_ref]",
  "mood": "warm_inviting | clean_minimal"
}
```
Purpose: Lifestyle scene generation.

### placement

```json
{
  "position": "place [product] on marble counter",
  "scale": "prominent | natural"
}
```
Purpose: Position product in scene.

### material_treatment

```json
{
  "primary_material": "clear_glass | metal | plastic",
  "rendering_notes": "preserve caustics and internal reflections"
}
```
Purpose: Material-specific rendering instructions.

### fidelity (CRITICAL for source images)

```json
{
  "preserve_colors": "true product colors (fix color cast)",
  "preserve_artwork": "bee mascot - same design",
  "hero_features": "texture pattern is key differentiator"
}
```
Purpose: FIX photography problems, PRESERVE product identity. Always include when processing [source]/[product].

### enhancement

```json
{
  "sharpness": "tack_sharp",
  "color_treatment": "vibrant | natural | desaturated"
}
```
Purpose: Post-processing enhancements.

### custom_spec

```json
{
  "instruction": "dramatic shot with water droplets",
  "style_reference": "Apple product photography"
}
```
Purpose: Fully open-ended creative direction.

### output

```json
{
  "format": "png | jpeg | webp",
  "size": "1K | 2K",
  "aspect_ratio": "1:1 | 16:9 | 4:3",
  "filename": "product_hero"
}
```
Purpose: Output specifications.

---

## USE PATTERNS

### Pattern 1: Extract with Transparent Background

```python
image_studio(
    images=[{"path": "inbox/photo.jpg", "label": "source"}],
    extraction={"target_description": "glass jar in [source]"},
    background={"treatment": "transparent"},
    material_treatment={"primary_material": "clear_glass"},
    fidelity={"preserve_colors": "true colors", "hero_features": "glass clarity"}
)
```
Result: Extracted jar, transparent PNG, identity preserved.

### Pattern 2: Extract with White Background

```python
image_studio(
    images=[{"path": "inbox/photo.jpg", "label": "source"}],
    extraction={"target_description": "product in [source]"},
    background={"treatment": "solid_color", "color": "white"}
)
```
Result: Product on pure white background.

### Pattern 3: Lifestyle Scene with Style Reference

```python
image_studio(
    images=[
        {"path": "inbox/t/product.jpg", "label": "product"},
        {"path": "inbox/t/mood.jpg", "label": "style_ref"}
    ],
    scene={"environment": "modern kitchen", "style": "match [style_ref]"},
    placement={"position": "place [product] on counter"},
    lighting={"type": "natural_window", "special_requirements": "match [style_ref]"}
)
```
Result: Product in kitchen matching reference mood/lighting.

### Pattern 4: Product Family Composition

```python
image_studio(
    images=[
        {"path": "pending/t/jar_500ml.png", "label": "main"},
        {"path": "pending/t/jar_1L.png", "label": "variant"}
    ],
    composition={"position": "[main] center front, [variant] right behind"},
    background={"treatment": "solid_color", "color": "white"}
)
```
Result: Family shot with main product prominent, variant supporting.

### Pattern 5: Hero Shot Enhancement

```python
image_studio(
    images=[{"path": "inbox/photo.jpg", "label": "source"}],
    extraction={"target_description": "product in [source]"},
    background={"treatment": "solid_color", "color": "#f5f5f5"},
    lighting={"type": "studio_3point"},
    material_treatment={"primary_material": "clear_glass"},
    fidelity={"preserve_colors": "true colors", "hero_features": "key differentiator"}
)
```
Result: Catalog-ready hero shot, identity preserved.

